    "rationale": "Disables FQDN-typed EndpointSlices and adds IP validation via checkRestrictedIP() with IPv4-mapped/compatible IPv6 normalization. Prevents SSRF attacks targeting restricted IPs such as cloud metadata service (169.254.169.254), loopback, link-local, and Azure/AWS metadata endpoints.",
